/span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            关于大峡谷庄园与幸运农场\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           位于波奎特产区的 Gran del Val 大峡谷庄园目前已是百年品牌，这是属于四代人的传承接力。约瑟夫·德·迪亚努斯 (Joseph De Dianous) 就是因修建运河从法国来到巴拿马公司工作。1914年，家族购买了第一块土地，并在那里创立了Finca Gladys种植园。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/ruUhEq093b6rhBGqb21fzOK8voeNEecY0hf2EAKXOs7e1RH9gvY3bh68UTxfCht7icib1ohnlQnGVw3Y5MFVEiaBodlzoRK7Pj6oRfZTK5hUy4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           在第二代家族成员的管理下庄园获得了巴拿马第一家雨林联盟、纽约和 Hiro Coffee Japan认证的有机咖啡工坊。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b6MAL1d7hswU3emQHMjDQesbpB1ibpAENQwExDVaiaw0aYX7ia6vYUGnW2m4xwPyGRKOcBarl40icpKiaBadmicEaRBRhSY4ibmSDuiceE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Ricardo Fernández Carazo and his wife Teresita De Dianous\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b70aUYbOpfyW92nib2GTak9dfd3eSeJ3d3TI3ESmibjTTln5LmebHCJh2dgbiaR1m3ASCw8I2JxcWoJIz4VAualzHYm8dsvrnr8Ig/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<h3 data-aos=\"zoom-in\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;padding: 0px;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;list-style: none;font-family: sans-serif;transform: translateZ(0px) scale(1);opacity: 1;transition-property: opacity, transform;font-size: 1rem;font-weight: 300;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(222, 184, 135);top: -30px;transition-duration: 3s;transition-timing-function: ease;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n          Ecological Coffee Mill\n         </span>\n</h3>\n<h3 data-aos=\"zoom-in\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;padding: 0px;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;list-style: none;font-family: sans-serif;transform: translateZ(0px) scale(1);opacity: 1;transition-property: opacity, transform;font-size: 1rem;font-weight: 300;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(222, 184, 135);top: -30px;transition-duration: 3s;transition-timing-function: ease;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n          Ecological Coffee Mill\n         </span>\n</h3>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Ecological Coffee Mill\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           第三代家族开始向瑞典出口咖啡，持续扩张获得更广泛的合作伙\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           伴。到 2000 年，Gran Del Val 跨越了世界的边界，向更多国家如日本、德国、中国台湾、美国、澳大利亚和葡萄牙等连接出口\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           贸易。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b6t0b0Q272iaunfeYfjEmyzANh00mpibQD5bToXqFZFzf0ewia62S3icLicJmXNfXsGkYYgbwiaiatcOI9ME0pzm4a1AKKjicjn0zLbEm0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            第三代：Ricardo, Edgar and Rodolfo Fernandez De Dianous\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           2020年品牌开启全新形象发展线上业务，一路走来家族成员们不负所托，将庄园打造为巴拿马咖啡的经典形象。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/ruUhEq093b7CuUZVicOng5NGdu9G9gUxdibK53geAh6Fib5e6uqbNoKHJnVacCHUbP9ll7uCReWNe6cibIVpTzUJoNqwFVwU1iadiaDw0BWPlAhiaE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           目前已是第四代 Fernandez 家族在管理\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fmmecoa_jpg%2FruUhEq093b7N9hfiaEeLwZzLQxtBk3dxkaYyXOXNH4329PpXJ9RAj8wqOlqiawqtxTWcMx3abeD29ib3EoQ4VCSOia8rE10q9dWiaxGFuDf392AQ%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4443568022544367617\" data-ratio=\"1.7733990147783252\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4443568022544367617\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"720\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           庄园目前拥有三个农场，每一座农场的海拔高度略有不同，加上土壤环境的差异化给产品线输入了丰富的风味特色。最初的 FINCA GLADYS 农场，位于海拔 1,200 至 1,300 米之间，它的特点是周围环绕着原始泉水生机勃勃的自然风光。第二座FINCA GRAN PARAISO 农场毗邻火山口，海拔在 1,300-1,400 米之间。这两个农场都以 Typica、Caturra、Catuai 品种为特色。第三座 FINCA LA FORTUNA 位于海拔 1,500 至 1,600\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           米之间，主要是 Gesha 和 Typica 品种；周围间接环绕种植着部分牛油果树，既可以起到给咖啡树遮阴的效果，土壤也会相对保持在疏松的、沙质的状态，呈微酸性至中性。在咖啡处理法上主要以水洗和自然日晒为主；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b7zhmX2jjtT1awWvO29bQ0E8rrkx7q9qXa1Sj3NrDK3vibXaUovrttkA8kCnjPqr7kFPgQjicoQjicERUWY01XbF305uluoprlt14/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-size: 17px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
